  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\">最佳 PVP 套裝</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>英文版</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>此套件包含專業進行 PVP 所需的一切。</strong><br><strong>使用它，你的技術將大幅提升，並獲得更高的 FPS 與更少的延遲。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>包含：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>炫酷鑽石劍<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>改良護甲<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>炫酷鑽石護甲<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>專業級金蘋果<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>縮小盾牌<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>縮小火焰<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>減少非必要物品<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>隱形图腾<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>改良羊毛<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>+FPS</strong></li>\n<li><strong>-LAG</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙文版</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>此套件包含專業進行 PVP 所需的一切。</strong><br><strong>使用它，你的技術將大幅提升，並獲得更高的 FPS 與更少的延遲。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>包含：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>縮小劍</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>炫酷鑽石劍</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>改良護甲</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>炫酷鑽石護甲</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>專業級金蘋果</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>縮小盾牌</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>縮小火焰</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>減少非必要物品</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>隱形图腾</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>改良羊毛</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>+FPS</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>-LAG</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"補充配件 Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/donate-me-126284950?utm_medium=clipboard_copy&utm_source=copyLink&utm_campaign=postshare_creator&utm_content=join_link\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_24a6377c-de2d-48a7-a0a9-5c2642f644cb.png\" width=\"177\" height=\"52\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@d_de_diego_d\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道\" width=\"183\" height=\"50\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftridex.webnode.es%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_caf0ba8d-3249-447f-b3b8-6507248fbba5.png\" width=\"194\" height=\"57\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 